                                "sense_id": "ef85436d-4593-32eb-9078-0ccea28da034",
                                "text": "... what if the woman cannot ſpeak any language that the judge doth underſtand, as Corniſh, Welſh, Dutch, or the like? then there ſhall be a Latimer, that is, an interpreter upon his oath to interpret truly ..."
                            },
                            {
