                                "sense_id": "ef85436d-4593-32eb-9078-0ccea28da034",
                                "text": "[…] royal and household latimers were so usual that he naturally provided Vortigern with one."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9646fd9a-924b-4009-8205-44c90369b2c6",
                                "sense_id": "ef85436d-4593-32eb-9078-0ccea28da034",
                                "text": "It is likely that Anglo-Norman formed a necessary element of Morris Regan's linguistic repertoire as a latimer […]"
